# Image Handling Rules

## Image DTO Usage

### Request DTOs (Input)

When creating or updating entities that include images, always use [ImageDto](mdc:src/core/dtos/requests/image.dto.ts):

```typescript
import { ImageDto } from 'src/core/dtos/requests/image.dto';

// In create DTOs
@ApiProperty({
  description: 'Image information',
  type: ImageDto,
  required: false,
})
@IsOptional()
@ValidateNested()
@Type(() => ImageDto)
image?: ImageDto;

// In update DTOs
@ApiProperty({
  description: 'Image information',
  type: ImageDto,
  required: false,
})
@IsOptional()
@ValidateNested()
@Type(() => ImageDto)
image?: ImageDto;
```

### Entity Definition

In entities, use [ImageDto](mdc:src/core/dtos/requests/image.dto.ts) for the image property:

```typescript
import { ImageDto } from 'src/core/dtos/requests/image.dto';

@AutoMap()
@Column({ type: 'jsonb', nullable: true })
image?: ImageDto;
```

### Response DTOs (Output)

For response DTOs, use [ImageResponseDto](mdc:src/core/dtos/responses/image-response.dto.ts):

```typescript
import { ImageResponseDto } from 'src/core/dtos/responses';

@AutoMap()
@ApiProperty({
  description: 'Image information',
  type: ImageResponseDto,
  nullable: true,
  required: false,
})
image?: ImageResponseDto;
```

## Default Image Mapping

### When Images are Optional

When mapping entities to response DTOs where the image property is optional, always use the appropriate default image mapping method from [CommonMappingHelpers](mdc:src/core/mapping-profiles/common-mapping.helpers.ts):

```typescript
import { CommonMappingHelpers } from 'src/core/mapping-profiles/common-mapping.helpers';

// For profile images
forMember(
  (dest) => dest.image,
  mapFrom((src) =>
    CommonMappingHelpers.mapProfileImageWithDefault(src, 'User profile picture'),
  ),
),

// For meal images
forMember(
  (dest) => dest.image,
  mapFrom((src) =>
    CommonMappingHelpers.mapMealImageWithDefault(src, 'Meal image'),
  ),
),

// For plan images
forMember(
  (dest) => dest.image,
  mapFrom((src) =>
    CommonMappingHelpers.mapPlanImageWithDefault(src, 'Plan image'),
  ),
),

// For generic images
forMember(
  (dest) => dest.image,
  mapFrom((src) =>
    CommonMappingHelpers.mapImageWithDefault(src, 'Default image'),
  ),
),
```

### Available Default Image Methods

- `mapProfileImageWithDefault()` - For user profile images
- `mapMealImageWithDefault()` - For meal images
- `mapPlanImageWithDefault()` - For plan images
- `mapImageWithDefault()` - For generic images

## Environment Variables

Configure default images using these environment variables:

```env
DEFAULT_PROFILE_IMAGE=https://your-cdn.com/images/default-profile.png
DEFAULT_MEAL_IMAGE=https://your-cdn.com/images/default-meal.png
DEFAULT_PLAN_IMAGE=https://your-cdn.com/images/default-plan.png
DEFAULT_IMAGE=https://your-cdn.com/images/default-image.png
```

## Validation Rules

- Always use `@IsOptional()` for image properties in DTOs
- Always use `@ValidateNested()` and `@Type(() => ImageDto)` for nested image validation
- Always use `nullable: true` in response DTOs for optional images
- Always provide appropriate alt text for accessibility

## Examples

### Complete Entity with Image

```typescript
@Entity('plans')
export class PlanEntity extends BaseEntity {
  @AutoMap()
  @Column()
  name: string;

  @AutoMap()
  @Column({ type: 'jsonb', nullable: true })
  image?: ImageDto;
}
```

### Complete Create DTO with Image

```typescript
export class CreatePlanDto {
  @ApiProperty({
    description: 'Plan image information',
    type: ImageDto,
    required: false,
  })
  @IsOptional()
  @ValidateNested()
  @Type(() => ImageDto)
  image?: ImageDto;
}
```

### Complete Response DTO with Image

```typescript
export class PlanResponseDto {
  @AutoMap()
  @ApiProperty({
    description: 'Plan image information',
    type: ImageResponseDto,
    nullable: true,
    required: false,
  })
  image?: ImageResponseDto;
}
```

### Complete Mapping Profile with Default Image

```typescript
createMap(
  mapper,
  PlanEntity,
  PlanResponseDto,
  forMember(
    (dest) => dest.image,
    mapFrom((src) =>
      CommonMappingHelpers.mapPlanImageWithDefault(src, 'Plan image'),
    ),
  ),
);
```
